OL,3,GNEWSAScottish grooming gangs inquiry to
OL,4,Astart next week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public inquiry into grooming gangs in
OL,7,FScotland will start next week, the
OL,8,FScottish government has announced.
OL,10,FLed by expert Prof Alexis Jay, the
OL,11,Finvestigation will look into
OL,12,Fgroup-based child sexual abuse and
OL,13,Fexploitation.
OL,15,FEducation Secretary Mairi McAllan said
OL,16,Fthe inquiry would have the "strongest
OL,17,Fpossible powers" to examine the issue.
OL,19,FIt comes after a survivor of grooming
OL,20,Fgang abuse accused ministers of taking
OL,21,Ftoo long to deliver on promises to work
OL,22,F"at pace".
